WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.625
- What did you say to Andy
to get kicked out of camp?

00:00:03.625 --> 00:00:06.625
♪♪

00:00:06.625 --> 00:00:09.625
- I was home from school,
and I was watchin' you.

00:00:09.625 --> 00:00:11.083
There was helicopters.

00:00:11.083 --> 00:00:13.000
Like, can you take me
to that day, please?

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.250
- This was during training camp,
and this particular day

00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:17.125
it was the receivers' day
to sign autographs.

00:00:17.125 --> 00:00:20.125
Well, so, I had
a groin issue at the time

00:00:20.125 --> 00:00:22.250
so I just felt like,
"Let me use this time

00:00:22.250 --> 00:00:24.750
to go get myself healthier
in the training room."

00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:26.625
We had a bit of a disagreement.

00:00:26.625 --> 00:00:28.250
And it was, like,
right in the doorway

00:00:28.250 --> 00:00:29.625
of where, you know,
people were—

00:00:29.625 --> 00:00:31.333
- A lot of players
and coaches saw it.

00:00:31.333 --> 00:00:33.208
- Yeah, and I think some
other people just, you know

00:00:33.208 --> 00:00:34.833
listened to the conversation.
- Right, right.

00:00:34.833 --> 00:00:36.625
- So, you know, he felt like
I was showin' him up.

00:00:36.625 --> 00:00:38.583
And Coach said, "Go home."

00:00:38.583 --> 00:00:41.375
"In the meantime," he said,
"Keep yourself in shape while you're at it."

00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:44.083
I'm in the house
maybe 20, 25 minutes.

00:00:44.083 --> 00:00:46.833
I start hearin' helicopters
or whatever

00:00:46.833 --> 00:00:48.375
but I didn't think much of it.

00:00:48.375 --> 00:00:50.458
Somebody came
and knocked at the door.

00:00:50.458 --> 00:00:52.000
And I looked through the blinds.

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:54.750
News trucks
were all out in my yard.

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:57.250
The helicopters and everybody
was around my house.

00:00:57.250 --> 00:00:59.125
I just tried
to have fun with it.

00:00:59.125 --> 00:01:02.500
Saw my ab bench,
took it outside.

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:04.875
I was, ya know,
entertaining the reporters

00:01:04.875 --> 00:01:07.083
and I was workin' out
at the same time.

00:01:07.083 --> 00:01:09.750
Little did anybody know,
I had an earpiece on.

00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:11.250
I called my publicist
at the time.

00:01:11.250 --> 00:01:12.875
She was listening to every question
that was being asked of me.

00:01:12.875 --> 00:01:14.875
And so she told me kind of
what to say, what not to say.

00:01:14.875 --> 00:01:17.125
And so I just basically said,
"No comment," or whatever.

00:01:17.125 --> 00:01:19.500
- Right.
- So, did you go back and you're like

00:01:19.500 --> 00:01:21.125
"Andy, I was keepin' myself in shape."

00:01:21.125 --> 00:01:22.750
- Well, yeah. I mean,
at some point

00:01:22.750 --> 00:01:23.500
he kinda figured that out.

